OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters gather on Garvaghy Road
OL,4,Aas Appeal judges overturn ban on
OL,5,ADrumcree parade
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Court of Appeal has overturned a
OL,8,Fban on Orangemen marching through a
OL,9,Flargely nationalist part of Northern
OL,10,FIreland on Sunday.
OL,12,FHowever in a further development, the
OL,13,FCourt of Appeal has approved a request
OL,14,Ffor the case to be heard tonight by a
OL,15,Fdifferent High Court judge.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
