OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%* ** %-,*,$%** %-& (,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters gather on Garvaghy Road
OL,4,Aas Appeal judges overturn ban on
OL,5,ADrumcree parade
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Drumcree parade, which in the 1990s
OL,8,Fsparked some of the most serious
OL,9,Fdisorder in Northern Ireland's history,
OL,10,Fhad been given permission to go ahead
OL,11,Falong the Garvaghy Road in Portadown
OL,12,Ffor the first time in almost three
OL,13,Fdecades, with restrictions in place.
OL,15,FThat decision was challenged in court
OL,16,Fon Saturday by the Garvaghy Road
OL,17,FResidents Group and a High Court judge
OL,18,Fissued an injunction halting the march
OL,19,Fruling the "long-running dispute"
OL,20,Fbetween residents and local Orangemen
OL,21,Fhad "the potential to escalate" should
OL,22,Fit proceed.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
